# @name createNaturalPersonWithoutGender
### Creation d'une natural person — sans gender (optionnel, expect 201)
POST {{apiUrl}}/natural-persons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/ld+json

{
  "firstname": "Jane",
  "lastname": "Doe",
  "birthday": "1985-01-01"
}

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 201 Created", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "Expected 201 Created");
    });
%}
